ַבָּת.", "condition_instruction_language": "de-Hebr", "conditions": [{"features": {"shabbat": true}, "type": "opensiddur:holiday-aggregate"}], "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/melokh_al_kol_haolam/vehanchilenu", "end_reference": true, "fragments": [{"page_start": false, "printed_page": "127", "scan": "s274", "text": "(וְהַנְחִילֵנוּ יְיָ אֱלֹהֵינוּ בְּאַהֲבָה וּבְרָצוֹן שַׁבַּת קָדְשֶׁךָ וְיָנוּחוּ בָהּ יִשְׂרָאֵל מְקַדְּשֵׁי שְׁמֶךָ.)"}], "marked": true, "paragraph": 1, "reference_unit": "prayer-part"}, {"corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/melokh_al_kol_haolam/conclusion", "fragments": [{"page_start": false, "printed_page": "127", "scan": "s274", "text": "וְטַהֵר לִבֵּנוּ לְעָבְדְּךָ בֶּאֱמֶת כִּי אַתָּה אֱלֹהִים אֱמֶת וּדְבָרְךָ "}], "paragraph": 1, "reference_unit": "prayer-part"}, {"conditions": [{"features": {"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/melokh_al_kol_haolam/malkenu": true}, "type": "opensiddur:variant"}], "fragments": [{"page_start": false, "printed_page": "127", "scan": "s274", "text": "(מלכנו)"}], "marked": true, "paragraph": 1}, {"fragments": [{"page_start": false, "printed_page": "127", "scan": "s274", "text": " אֱמֶת וְקַיָּם לָעַד. בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְיָ מֶלֶךְ עַל כָּל־הָאָרֶץ מְקַדֵּשׁ "}], "paragraph": 1}, {"conditions": [{"features": {"shabbat": true}, "type": "opensiddur:holiday-aggregate"}], "fragments": [{"join_next": true, "page_start": false, "printed_page": "127", "scan": "s274", "text": "(הַשַּׁבָּת וְ)"}], "marked": true, "paragraph": 1}, {"end_reference": true, "fragments": [{"page_start": false, "printed_page": "127", "scan": "s274", "text": "יִשְׂרָאֵל וְיוֹם הַזִּכָּרוֹן:"}], "paragraph": 1}]}, "review_encoding": true, "stem": "musaf_repetition_malkhuyot_close", "title": {"en": "Reign over the whole world", "he": "מלוך על כל העולם"}, "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/malkhuyot_close"}, "variants": []}
